{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/982720/extras/c5105b38f46af97c10adb0b6719a9610.poster.avif?t=1718140674\" width=600 height=219 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/982720/extras/c5105b38f46af97c10adb0b6719a9610.webm?t=1718140674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>The war persisted for 20 more years only to end in flames when the Nazis launched nuclear missiles on most of Europe. In the aftermath, the heart of Europe remains shrouded in the mystery of complete destruction and deadly radiation, inaccessible to the rest of the world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/982720/extras/46937d1ed6ab6064c01b2d0cf002c8cc.poster.avif?t=1718140674\" width=600 height=219 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/982720/extras/46937d1ed6ab6064c01b2d0cf002c8cc.webm?t=1718140674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>You play as Szymon, a 12-year-old boy who\u2019s just discovered a massive Nazi bunker while wandering the barren, nuclear wasteland of Poland after his mother\u2019s death. He\u2019s searching for an unknown man from a photograph his mother cherished. Who is he? Will you be able to find him?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/982720/extras/1e511f47d22d7aa46f0b496ac33ff965.poster.avif?t=1718140674\" width=600 height=219 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/982720/extras/1e511f47d22d7aa46f0b496ac33ff965.webm?t=1718140674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Descend into the retro futuristic bunker where advanced, industrial technology is intertwined with mysterious, Slavic pagan imagery and explore the underground city hidden within. Uncover the story of the bunker, from its takeover by Polish rebels to the ultimate fate of its inhabitants. What happened to them?  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/982720/extras/3bcc923b5ca55e38929fd5d4a164c5c2.poster.avif?t=1718140674\" width=600 height=219 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/982720/extras/3bcc923b5ca55e38929fd5d4a164c5c2.webm?t=1718140674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Despite the desolation of the bunker, a mysterious girl named Ewa contacts Szymon through the bunker\u2019s technology. If he can only find her, she might know the man in the picture. If he can find her, he finally won\u2019t be alone\u2026","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"182191d7290fad4e0c88605e86b99853d7292e00.jpg","localized_name":"Denial","name":"Denial","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/982720/182191d7290fad4e0c88605e86b99853d7292e00.jpg"},{"icon":"8e11c751b27019f1f88de42a8c1b3dccb46d843b.jpg","localized_name":"\u00dcbermensch","name":"\u00dcbermensch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/982720/8e11c751b27019f1f88de42a8c1b3dccb46d843b.jpg"},{"icon":"6383a3f8eadc610f869d374390fd7dff8e90da75.jpg","localized_name":"Untermensch","name":"Untermensch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/982720/6383a3f8eadc610f869d374390fd7dff8e90da75.jpg"},{"icon":"4ff43b9e3fff4d6fc989e3d84ff6f7e69dcc1211.jpg","localized_name":"Anger","name":"Anger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/publi